WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:04.683
In Blast, start a new campaign.

2
00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.253
First, pick an audience.

3
00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:10.198
Send it to your whole book, a group,

4
00:00:10.198 --> 00:00:12.653
or an automatic group of buyers.

5
00:00:12.733 --> 00:00:15.332
Here, choose VIP guests.

6
00:00:15.527 --> 00:00:16.882
Write a subject,

7
00:00:17.277 --> 00:00:19.333
then the email itself.

8
00:00:19.677 --> 00:00:22.871
Format your text with bold and italic.

9
00:00:24.377 --> 00:00:27.718
Click plus Event to add an event card.

10
00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:29.257
It shows the date

11
00:00:29.257 --> 00:00:31.233
and a Get tickets button.

12
00:00:31.313 --> 00:00:32.448
To add a link,

13
00:00:32.448 --> 00:00:35.750
open the three-dot menu and choose Link.

14
00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:37.980
Paste the address, write the words

15
00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:40.541
your reader will see, and insert it.

16
00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:43.600
The preview on the right

17
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.710
shows the email as you write.

18
00:00:46.213 --> 00:00:47.433
To send it later,

19
00:00:47.433 --> 00:00:50.495
pick a date and time with Schedule send.

20
00:00:50.613 --> 00:00:52.433
Or send it now.

21
00:00:52.513 --> 00:00:54.499
The review shows who will get it

22
00:00:54.499 --> 00:00:56.883
and how many people can be reached.

23
00:00:56.963 --> 00:00:59.383
Nothing sends until you confirm.

24
00:00:59.463 --> 00:01:01.104
Click Send now,

25
00:01:01.730 --> 00:01:03.067
and it's on the way.

26
00:01:06.527 --> 00:01:09.333
In Campaigns, it shows as sent.

27
00:01:09.977 --> 00:01:11.848
And Overview shows how many

28
00:01:11.848 --> 00:01:14.403
emails were delivered and opened.

29
00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:18.301
Open a sent campaign to see how it did:

30
00:01:18.697 --> 00:01:22.075
who it reached, deliveries, opens,

31
00:01:22.075 --> 00:01:26.036
link clicks, bounces and unsubscribes.

32
00:01:27.897 --> 00:01:29.427
Opens are an estimate,

33
00:01:29.427 --> 00:01:31.441
so treat them as a trend.

34
00:01:31.897 --> 00:01:34.292
Link clicks are the stronger signal.

35
00:01:34.697 --> 00:01:37.710
Get Mingla Host at usemingla

36
00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:40.034
dot com slash host.

